    {
      "question_number": 3,
      "stem_markdown": "The diagram shows the curve with equation \\(y = 8e^{-x} - e^{2x}\\). The curve crosses the \\(y\\)-axis at the point \\(A\\) and the \\(x\\)-axis at the point \\(B\\). The shaded region is bounded by the curve and the two axes.",
